  "content": "<p>《Just Dire Things》最初是我想要添加到游戏中的一些随机物品和方块的集合。然后事情就有点失控了……</p><p>这个模组添加了：</p><p>4个等级的资源，需要探索不同的Minecraft维度来解锁。</p><p>4个等级的工具，每个都有独特的能力，有些是前所未见的！</p><p>4个等级的盔甲，每个都有自己独特的技能！</p><p>许多围绕自动化设计的方块。包括：</p><p>方块破坏器/放置器</p><p>传感器</p><p>传送器</p><p>能量生成和分配方块。</p><p>未来还有更多计划，这只是第一版！</p><p>模组展示：</p><p>第一部分：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/inz9Jx9K9oc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>第二部分：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DnnYotwG7qs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>第三部分：</p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:638px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5Jq517MCltM\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>第四部分：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SLPO5Y5Mc7U?ab_channel=direwolf20\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2M8-V8YBayg\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ub6_h3ffnV0\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
